---
import SectionLabel from './SectionLabel.astro';
---

<section class="grid grid-cols-[200px_1fr] gap-12 border-t border-border py-[60px]">
  <SectionLabel index="01" label="ABOUT" />
  <div class="flex max-w-[680px] flex-col gap-5 font-display text-[22px] leading-[1.75] text-fg-2">
    <p class="m-0">
      I've spent most of my career helping teams turn ideas into products, mostly at early-stage
      companies, owning the frontend, partnering closely with design, and sweating the details
      that make software feel <em class="text-accent">polished</em>.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0">
      I'm always happy to work across the stack when it moves things forward. Lately that's
      React, TypeScript, GraphQL, TanStack, and leaning on AI to build faster, though I care less
      about the newest framework than software people actually enjoy using.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
